  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4c01317e8d7a521f09daf7da735feafb8d1e5e50fcc182d6c94d62618e79c46",
      "text": "重新转动的故事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b083d2598ee0b383fd82315b2d0431311ecf372877362b7a01228dff8912b9b",
      "text": "看着坦白真相的凉的身影，一希被凉和偶像所吸引。而凉为了实现自己的梦想，前往了315 Production。然而在途中，他发现被不良纠缠的女高中生并上前解围。这时大吾出现了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4c01317e8d7a521f09daf7da735feafb8d1e5e50fcc182d6c94d62618e79c46",
      "text": "重新转动的故事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17e8fbe3f691b6fa9fed3cf8fac84350b23b348c918551568f85080f91221c82",
      "text": "一希的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34d5e2073182bf93759f2f7d1b75c942bd62f1ffcb55dc06e209765a844c775f",
      "text": "…这次也是，拙劣之作。\n根本不是能公之于世的作品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0334e829bdf433a871b8edbd398d9757fc725ba30bb502d10f913fdab3fb75f1",
      "text": "（…这也是理所当然的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd820ccc1d404babdb63176ff8b60504403d3d99f2049011f30039bda69383bf",
      "text": "（…我开始写属于自己的书，\n是为了让父亲看到我真正的模样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4b06e562880e360cd57297a4e1da877862afb748899052fe799068d902d45f4",
      "text": "（…不是影子写手，而是我自己）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d92a51cfe4b6d2c8b9abd76da1531901ed13dfc203ed8c16971e028ca26b229a",
      "text": "…在没有直面故事的世界的情况下写出来的东西。\n书会变得如此丑陋也是理所当然的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79088d8b0c33d321756b0eda6efb5067a10256ac5f9843a48a9371c1eb85a9dd",
      "text": "（…明明心里明白。即便如此依然写下去，是因为……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07aedb21afa20b6977e8cdb3f391c476e9d62be2aa54e84e73be03f0a640dc0d",
      "text": "…无论如何，都想引起父亲的注意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ffcaa43b3e93fbace7b88dea7221795ac2a55157ebc33adf8b1d9d8bffce2d3",
      "text": "…用我自己的心，和语言……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
